<SECTION image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="grid-scale battery storage facility with rows of large white battery containers, industrial renewable energy infrastructure, editorial photography style">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2 style="text-align: left"><B>Battery storage costs drop <I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">89%</SPAN></I> in <I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">three years</SPAN></I></B></H2>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="stats" cellSize="12" orientation="horizontal" horizontalAlign="left">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="89%">
        <P>cost reduction since 2022</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="3x">
        <P>faster deployment velocity</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="40%">
        <P>better grid integration</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
    <P style="text-align: left">Lithium-ion battery prices plummeted from <SPAN text-color="#228B22">$1,200/kWh to $139/kWh</SPAN> since 2022, making grid-scale storage economically viable across all major markets. Tesla's Megapack installations now operate in 15 countries.</P>
    <P style="text-align: left">Deployment velocity has tripled. California's Moss Landing facility added <SPAN text-color="#228B22">3 GWh capacity in 18 months</SPAN> — enough to power 225,000 homes for four hours during peak demand periods.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>